2Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fbecome-an-hgv-driver",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"Z69dwREAAFJZFY9q","subpath1",[],"en-gb","careers","2025-02-14T15:14:36+0000","Document","7aa15962-284b-4001-856c-f6e157d50528",false,{"link_type":18},[23,61,92,113,147,187],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":28,"id":59,"slice_type":60,"slice_label":43},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[27],{},{"theme":29,"PageHeaderTitle":30,"PageHeaderText":31,"PageHeaderCtaText":37,"PageHeaderCtaUrl":38,"secondaryCtaText":43,"secondaryCtaLabel":43,"secondaryCtaUrl":44,"PageHeaderImage":46,"heroImage":57,"videoContent":58,"showPremiumLogo":20},"standard","Become an HGV Driver for Evri",[32],{"type":33,"text":34,"spans":35,"direction":36},"paragraph","We're on the lookout for enthusiastic HGV Drivers to join our fleet. With depots and hubs across the UK and day and night availability you can find your perfect role with Evri. ",[],"ltr","Apply on Evri Careers",{"link_type":39,"key":40,"url":41,"target":42},"Web","14eb889d-2e76-43d8-8dcb-4be70009c0e7","become-an-hgv-driver.html\u002F\u002Fjobs.dayforcehcm.com\u002Fen-GB\u002Fevri\u002FCANDIDATEPORTAL?searchText=HGV","_blank",null,{"link_type":45},"Any",{"dimensions":47,"alt":50,"copyright":43,"url":51,"id":52,"edit":53},{"width":48,"height":49},300,85,"Evri","become-an-hgv-driver.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Faa61d067-a054-4345-bb58-bc29b749ab11_evri-new.svg","Yp3_chIAACMAe4NJ",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$685be352-9a1d-4aca-9374-66032117e119","page_header",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":62,"primary":64,"id":90,"slice_type":91,"slice_label":43},[63],{},{"CardImage":65,"CardAvatar":76,"CardTitle":77,"CardText":78,"ButtonText":43,"ButtonUrl":89,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":66,"alt":69,"copyright":43,"url":70,"id":71,"edit":72},{"width":67,"height":68},1000,665,"Female lorry driver sat in the cab of her vehicle","become-an-hgv-driver.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F4bd84296-a8ab-42c6-ab9b-83bb5931cd67_20220725-EVRI-People+Photography-190.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,4,6240,4150&w=1000&h=665","ZcOoyxEAACEA8Umo",{"x":54,"y":73,"zoom":74,"background":75},-0.6410256410256411,0.16025641025641027,"#fff","none","About the role",[79,86],{"type":33,"text":80,"spans":81,"direction":36},"At Evri, our HGV drivers are an essential part of our business. You’ll play a vital part in keeping our operations running smoothly and in making sure our customers’ parcels are where they need to be when they need to be there. Deliver parcels with a mixture of multi-drop responsibilities and trunking, giving you better flexibility and work life balance. ",[82],{"start":83,"end":84,"type":85},227,228,"strong",{"type":33,"text":87,"spans":88,"direction":36},"The role is consistent. It’s familiar. Delivering parcels safely and efficiently. And it’s different. It’s flexible. Shorter, local routes. It’s balanced, sharing the load between driving and physical work. And you take autonomy for your own routes. Problem-solve. Make the best decisions for the business and our customers. We offer the training and support you’ll need to get started and keep you safe out on the road with a thorough induction process.",[],{"link_type":45},"card$d30df186-73e2-4640-8038-84a857d6397c","card",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":93,"primary":94,"id":111,"slice_type":112,"slice_label":43},[],{"title":95,"bodyText":96,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":103,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":43,"buttonLink":104,"image":105},"A day in the life of an HGV Driver",[97,100],{"type":33,"text":98,"spans":99,"direction":36},"“A typical day would include completing my vehicle checks, as a Cat C + E driver I tend to drive our longer routes, ensuring the safe, efficient driving of vehicles from the warehouse to our clients and other sites in the EVRi. I ensure all parcels are collected and delivered safely. There can be some paperwork to update and I may be required to assist the warehouse staff with loading items from time to time. I keep the Transport Manager updated with any problems on the roads and they can help find an alternative routes if necessary.",[],{"type":33,"text":101,"spans":102,"direction":36},"I tend to work on shifts which could involve a night shift or a day shift. Our shift patterns tend to include any 5 shifts out of 7, which could include some weekend work but rotas are given in advance.”",[],true,{"link_type":45},{"dimensions":106,"alt":43,"copyright":43,"url":107,"id":108,"edit":109},{"width":67,"height":68},"become-an-hgv-driver.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2V6iZbqstJ98vBF_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-167.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&w=1000&h=665","Z2V6iZbqstJ98vBF",{"x":54,"y":110,"zoom":55,"background":56},5,"feature_banner$b9b5aa60-4e65-44dc-b2ca-ec94af28fe5e","feature_banner",{"variation":114,"version":25,"items":115,"primary":143,"id":145,"slice_type":146,"slice_label":43},"listNoIcon",[116,119,122,125,128,131,134,137,140],{"title":117,"content":118,"isNumbered":103},"Discounts on Evri products with over 1,000 retailers",[],{"title":120,"content":121,"isNumbered":103},"Up to 24 days holiday, exclusive of bank holidays",[],{"title":123,"content":124,"isNumbered":103},"Development opportunities such as supervisor or transport manager",[],{"title":126,"content":127,"isNumbered":103},"Health and well-being benefits and discounts",[],{"title":129,"content":130,"isNumbered":103},"Choose how many hours you work",[],{"title":132,"content":133,"isNumbered":103},"Opportunity for overtime",[],{"title":135,"content":136,"isNumbered":103},"Great career progression",[],{"title":138,"content":139,"isNumbered":103},"Mental health support",[],{"title":141,"content":142,"isNumbered":103},"We will pay for your continuous professional development with our Driver Academy",[],{"theme":29,"title":144,"description":43,"showPaddingTop":20},"Our Benefits","list_block$766c22de-7cf8-4b77-aff5-f7b70aee33b8","list_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":148,"primary":150,"id":186,"slice_type":91,"slice_label":43},[149],{},{"CardImage":151,"CardAvatar":76,"CardTitle":161,"CardText":162,"ButtonText":182,"ButtonUrl":183,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":152,"alt":155,"copyright":43,"url":156,"id":157,"edit":158},{"width":153,"height":154},612,345,"Evri branded truck outside of Barnsley hub being unloaded","become-an-hgv-driver.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F241875b9-e0bc-4eb6-b2eb-fe8978b599bd_Branded+Evri+truck.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=0,534,6240,3518&w=612&h=345","ZGIa1REAACIA6cer",{"x":54,"y":159,"zoom":160,"background":75},-52,0.09807692307692308,"About Us",[163,170,173,176,179],{"type":33,"text":164,"spans":165},"Every parcel, every person, every place – every delivery made for you.",[166,169],{"start":54,"end":167,"type":168},70,"em",{"start":54,"end":167,"type":85},{"type":33,"text":171,"spans":172},"Evri is leading the way in creating responsible delivery experiences for everyone, everywhere. And we’re doing that by offering the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels without costing the earth.",[],{"type":33,"text":174,"spans":175},"Whether it’s a customer sending a present to a friend, a marketplace trader shipping in bulk or a major retailer such as John Lewis, asos or Next, we’ve got it covered. With our team of 30,000 couriers, thousands of local ParcelShops and a growing network of hubs and depots across the country, we safely get parcels from A to everywhere.",[],{"type":33,"text":177,"spans":178},"And it’s not just customers and retailers who trust us. We’ve won loads of industry awards over the past few years, including gongs for IT, innovation and our green fleet.",[],{"type":33,"text":180,"spans":181},"But we wouldn’t be the biggest dedicated parcel delivery company in the UK without amazing people. We’re a friendly, ambitious and diverse bunch, united by a passion for delivering the best customer experience. We have great opportunities throughout the business, so take a look to see where you might fit in. We can’t wait to hear from you.",[],"Learn more about Evri",{"link_type":39,"key":184,"url":185},"81ac89b2-7f6c-48ab-89fe-24eca8ef667b","become-an-hgv-driver.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fabout-us","card$b237319d-51ec-4f13-8dfe-bd888a884d37",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":188,"primary":190,"id":200,"slice_type":201,"slice_label":43},[189],{},{"heading":191,"description":192,"image":193},"We're TRUSTED by our customers, retailers and colleagues.","We provide delivery services for most of the UK's top retail brands including Next, ASOS, boohoo, Missguided, PrettyLittleThing, John Lewis, Debenhams, eBay and Amazon.",{"dimensions":194,"alt":195,"copyright":43,"url":196,"id":197,"edit":198},{"width":67,"height":68},"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","become-an-hgv-driver.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh",{"x":54,"y":199,"zoom":55,"background":56},8,"trust_pilot$b4f2b8f0-0686-4a9f-9d70-784139e7658b","trust_pilot",[23,61,92,113,147,187],["Reactive",204],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":205,"$sclients":271,"$sglobal-basket-count":43},{"abtasty":206,"accessibe":209,"appPromoBanner":212,"autoDivertUpdates":215,"awin":218,"bulkInternational":221,"bulkSendEnabled":224,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":227,"enableBasketCount":230,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":233,"euCustomsDuty":236,"groovyAdvert":239,"newInternationalSendFlow":242,"newinternationalpages":249,"oohPreferenceFlag":253,"opentel":256,"premium":259,"savedCards":